# .dockerignore — ISSUE-103 (2026-10-02)
# COPY . . previously baked data/ 1.6GB (oracle.db 1.4GB), .git/ 49M, ψ/ 15M,
# tests/ 3.2M AND the host .env (real MT5 credentials) into every image layer.
# Disk hit 100% mid-deploy 2026-10-02 because rebuilds re-accumulate these
# layers. Runtime NEVER reads baked data/ — every compose file shadows
# /app/data with a volume (named volume or bind mount).
#
# KEEP baked (runtime needs them): scripts/, broky/, metty/, shared/, docker/,
# pyproject.toml, Dockerfile, farm_variants.yml.

# Secrets — /app/.env leak class (ISSUE-099) dies with this
.env
.env.*

# Runtime data — always volume-mounted, never read from the baked copy
data
*.db
*.log
*.pkl
*.joblib
models

# VCS / host-only tooling
.git
.gitignore
.claude
.synapse
.codex
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
.venv
venv
__pycache__
*.pyc
*.pyo

# Host-only agent memory system — zero runtime references
ψ

# Tests / build artifacts
tests
graphify-out
*.egg-info
build
dist
.DS_Store